Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.94,0:00:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.18,0:00:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning Sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning Angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurricane!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rainbow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.34,0:00:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.26,0:01:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish these trains were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We could be heroes of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.10,0:01:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you possibly be “heroes”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,when you’re this careless with insects?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out, Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.30,0:01:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Wolnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.42,0:01:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,With my newest invention, Sirius, at your service,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,no one will dare to harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve got yet another wrinkle in the corner of my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.54,0:01:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie, I can get you the moon and the stars,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:02:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can’t do anything about wrinkles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t care! I want to look young!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s this magical “Energy Seed”,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,a source of unlimited vital energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.98,0:02:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If we get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you’d stay young forever, and I’d have unlimited power!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Go find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.74,0:02:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This type of seed is extremely small. We won’t find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what? I’ve made a transformation gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.82,0:02:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d have a better time searching if I’m shrunken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be long, Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.06,0:02:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll give you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.46,0:03:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Wolnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a big train!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The big train’s inside is just like our house!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your dad’s stuff. Don’t touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He says
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,his “Energy Seed” is missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and he must find it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,“Energy Seed”?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess being so small isn’t all that convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not over here, Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.90,0:04:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not over here, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.66,0:04:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The goats have the Energy Seed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting it will be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Energy Seed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks just like a gem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.78,0:04:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the Energy Seed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What… What is…?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my newly invented tank train,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.14,0:05:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,“Sirius”.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the Energy Seed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I’ve transformed our toy trains into tanks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, Mr. Slowy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Let’s summon them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Daybreak!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rainbow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning Angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.54,0:05:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurricane!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning Sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out, Thunderbolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of our Magic Trains, Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.34,0:06:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll make you guys shrink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll see just how well your Magic Trains fare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you’re quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, my train doesn’t have any defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Rainbow Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You blocked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now’s my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll deliver the last hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, your train is a mechanic train.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not for attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.22,0:07:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.90,0:07:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now’s my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Magic Trains are no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.18,0:07:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The plants here are huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Beetle, how did you grow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.62,0:08:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t grow. You guys shrunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shrunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We really did shrink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll miss out on so many foods if I’m this small.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a spray to make us grow back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We can return whenever we’d like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.86,0:08:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Beetle, we still have to go home and do homework today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go home and eat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Beetle, we’ve already found the Energy Seed for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so we’ll be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But you guys are the only hope for saving the Big Tree World!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Saving the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. The Energy Seed is the Sun’s life essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My job is to collect these essences
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and deliver them to the Big Tree’s Summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can’t deliver the Energy Seed to the Summit
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,within three months,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the Big Tree World will wither and all of its insects will go extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I’m old and not as fast as I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I might not be able to make it on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Beetle, we’ll go save the Big Tree World, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, we have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.42,0:09:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,traveling the world also counts as education.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Beetle,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you can leave this great mission to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Big Tree World’s entrance is up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll need to deliver the Energy Seed to the Big Tree’s Summit
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.86,0:10:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re just climbing the tree, right? That’s easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.90,0:10:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are trees actually this huge?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the eyes of insects, the world is, in fact, this big.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So how long will it take us to get the seed up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn’t transforming back to normal make it easier?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Delivering the seed is a tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be done from the perspective of the insects,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.10,0:10:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.42,0:10:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Energy Seed is mine now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic Trains, assemble!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Assemble?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic assembly, unmatchable energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.86,0:11:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We look awesome while assembled!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do more things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We also have more power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re also faster than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.70,0:11:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Son?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be asking YOU that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:11:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.42,0:12:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I came onto the train to find Wilie,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and the next thing I know, the train’s flown off to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You better take us home right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Mr. Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie, I’ve located the Energy Seed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the one that promises eternal youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s with the goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! Let’s get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Off we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.78,0:12:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! We’re going out!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
